  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0d822886221c0364b9fc056e41f01c23, type: 3}
  m_Name: 2_MechanicRoom
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Tutorial
  ID: 1
  Message:
  - <color=#CC8C4C>Mechanic Room</color> has 2 benches where both the benches are
    used to craft different items.
  - The bench under the orange light is the <color=#FF7E00><b>Workbench</b></color>
    which can be used to craft resources.
  - The bench under the white light is the <color=#999999><b>Tool Creation Bench</b></color>
    which can be used to craft tools. You can craft a Pickaxe that can mine ores
    and alien ruins or an Axe that can harvest plants
  - Tap on any of the bench to start crafting
